The public endpoint is a capped, position-filtered sample. It is not a complete
league roster feed, and the ingest does not claim that it is.

The useful public filters were:

```text
A, G, F, M, D, FM, MD, FMD
```

Measured 2026 coverage:

| league | available non-empty weeks | treatment of remaining weeks |
|---|---:|---|
| MLS | 1-20 | weeks 21-38 were explicitly probed with `A`; all were empty |
| Liga MX | 1-5 | weeks 6-38 were explicitly probed with `A`; all were empty |

All eight filters were collected for every week that returned data. Once the
